    {
      "t0": 0.0,
      "t1": 30.0,
      "text": " Oh, let's see, um... This month we went to a really lovely wedding in Portugal, and it was just this whole trip. We hit up, like, Delft in the Netherlands, which I love, and then went down to Porto, and then the wedding in the Douro Valley, and, uhm..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 30.0,
      "t1": 40.0,
      "text": " [BLANK_AUDIO]"
    },
    {
      "t0": 30.140000343322754,
      "t1": 36.140000343322754,
      "text": " From there to Barcelona. It was great. And then we had an absolutely hellish..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 37.140000343322754,
      "t1": 47.140000343322754,
      "text": " flight back, where everything got cancelled and delayed and the— the... gate agents were... fucking useless."
    },
    {
      "t0": 53.970001220703125,
      "t1": 71.97000122070312,
      "text": " I've been thinking a lot about what I want to do next, and I'm not sure I have a good answer."
    },
    {
      "t0": 71.97000122070312,
      "t1": 88.97000122070312,
      "text": " I think it intersects pretty heavily with my ADHD."
    },
    {
      "t0": 89.375,
      "t1": 119.375,
      "text": ", because I just keep jumping around from project to project. I just don't fucking know. I should probably book another session with my therapist. I think I'm due for a therapy session. And I just need to get that shit on the books. I think it was kind of a mistake to not work with them."
    },
    {
      "t0": 118.73500061035156,
      "t1": 148.73500061035156,
      "text": " Well, I quit. I think I'm kind of overdue for that, but, um... you know. Water under the bridge. I... I don't know. I just need a direction I can sink my teeth into and feel good about. And I feel like it's time to set that direction."
    },
    {
      "t0": 148.73500061035156,
      "t1": 158.73500061035156,
      "text": " [BLANK_AUDIO]"
    },
    {
      "t0": 149.41000366210938,
      "t1": 179.41000366210938,
      "text": ", I've got a bunch of different ideas of what that direction could be, but they're kinda just like rough ideas, and I need something that I can, like, commit to, and live with. I don't fuckin' know. I don't know what that is. AI coding has been really good for... when my brain's not working."
    },
    {
      "t0": 177.98499298095703,
      "t1": 183.98499298095703,
      "text": " And letting me be lazy, but I'm still trying to wrap my head around what it is, and kinda..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 184.98499298095703,
      "t1": 187.98499298095703,
      "text": " What it fucking means to me, you know?"
    },
    {
      "t0": 190.48499298095703,
      "t1": 191.98499298095703,
      "text": " Um..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 194.48499298095703,
      "t1": 195.98499298095703,
      "text": " I don't..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 196.98499298095703,
      "t1": 197.98499298095703,
      "text": " I don't..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 199.48499298095703,
      "t1": 200.48499298095703,
      "text": " I don't know."
    },
    {
      "t0": 201.48499298095703,
      "t1": 202.98499298095703,
      "text": " That's it."
    }
